# Citation metadata for the midphysac research compendium.
#
# `version` and `date-released` are deliberately absent: the repository is
# mid-rebuild for the A2PA study and nothing has been released since v1.0.0.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "midphysac"
abstract: >-
  Research compendium for a retrospective study of attitudes towards physical
  activity (A2PA) and cognitive SuperAging in old-old women, pooling the
  COSACTIW and KOKOSA samples. Earlier releases carry the code behind Georgi et
  al. (2026), Acta Psychologica, which asked a different question of a different
  comparison group.
authors:
  - family-names: "Mana"
    given-names: "Josef"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7817-3978"
repository-code: "https://github.com/josefmana/cosactiw-midphysac"
url: "https://github.com/josefmana/cosactiw-midphysac"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - physical activity
  - attitudes towards physical activity
  - SuperAging
  - cognitive ageing
  - causal inference
  - research compendium
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.20339953
    description: >-
      Concept DOI. Always resolves to the most recent archived release of this
      repository. Cite this one unless you need a specific version.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.20339954
    description: >-
      Version DOI for release v1.0.0, the code behind Georgi et al. (2026),
      Acta Psychologica.
